{"title": "Adaptable Skullduggery", "pageid": 25865, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Adaptable_Skullduggery", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Adaptable Skullduggery</b> is a passive feature that allows the user to perform <a href=\"/wiki/Sneak_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack\">Sneak Attacks</a> with any weapon.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This creature can perform a Sneak Attack with any weapon, not only those marked as Finesse. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gravedigger_Karcen\" title=\"Gravedigger Karcen\">Gravedigger Karcen</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Flux\" title=\"Lady Flux\">Lady Flux</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714221855\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 447/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1525/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 793/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 11/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 217/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643686/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   24.142      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   24.142      1 -total\n 38.41%    9.272      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 16.22%    3.917      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 16.07%    3.879      1 Template:PageS